    "detailed_description": "Spaceborne Survivors is a minimalistic time-based survival game.<br />\r\nDefend Human space colonies from invading fleets of corporate overlords and alien conquerors. Endure until the reinforcements arrive! Gather experience cores and improve your chances as well as boost your comrades!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nTrailer Music by Karl Casey @ White Bat Audio<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStarting Tips:<br />\r\nTake your time to grab experience cores, they don't disappear.<br />\r\nGet offensive weapons at first, to give you a better edge and don't be afraid of dying.",
